| `actions/categories.ts` | Action interface | MEDIUM | Server action contract |
| Filter/Sort queries | Query optimization | HIGH | Filter results accuracy |
| Search integration | New feature | LOW | Search results with filters |

**Critical Risk**: Prop rename propagates through multiple files. Incorrect rename breaks filter/sort drawers.

