|------|------------|
| Prop rename breaks parent components | Scope 1 regression tests catch before commit |
| Query optimization returns wrong filters | Dual implementation + comparison testing |
| Dead code deletion breaks build | grep verification before deletion |
| Performance regression in optimized queries | Measure baseline vs optimized |

